{"version":3,"createdAt":1791626412777,"mainModel":{"schemaVersion":8,"id":"cm_mv2812q1","key":"cm_mv2812q1","name":"Planchard Chapter8 - review Q1-Q16 - browser 2026-10-10","kind":"part","authoringMode":"fully-parametric","localFrame":{"origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"xAxis":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0},"yAxis":{"x":0,"y":1,"z":0},"zAxis":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1}},"references":[{"id":"origin","type":"origin","name":"Origin","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"plane:top","type":"plane","name":"Top Plane","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"normal":{"x":0,"y":1,"z":0},"xAxis":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"plane:front","type":"plane","name":"Front Plane","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"normal":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1},"xAxis":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"plane:right","type":"plane","name":"Right Plane","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"normal":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0},"xAxis":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1}},{"id":"axis:x","type":"axis","name":"X Axis","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"direction":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"axis:y","type":"axis","name":"Y Axis","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"direction":{"x":0,"y":1,"z":0}},{"id":"axis:z","type":"axis","name":"Z Axis","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"direction":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1}}],"parameters":{},"sketches":[{"id":"sk_1mruo","name":"X·Z sketch","plane":"top","offset":0,"referenceId":"plane:top","points":[],"entities":[],"constraints":[],"diagnostics":[],"status":"fully-defined"}],"features":[],"history":[],"parts":[],"assemblies":[],"appearances":[],"notes":[],"markups":[],"rules":{},"metadata":{"authoringSystem":"parametric-v1"},"topologyBindings":[],"namedSelections":[],"revision":1,"lastRebuild":{"ok":true,"signature":"{\"definitionId\":\"cm_mv2812q1\",\"features\":[],\"history\":[{\"id\":\"history:sketch:sk_1mruo\",\"kind\":\"sketch\",\"suppressed\":false,\"targetId\":\"sk_1mruo\"}],\"overrides\":{},\"revision\":1,\"sketches\":[{\"constraints\":[],\"entities\":[],\"id\":\"sk_1mruo\",\"name\":\"X·Z sketch\",\"offset\":0,\"plane\":\"top\",\"points\":[],\"referenceId\":\"plane:top\"}]}","issues":[],"rebuiltAt":1791626398021},"price":500,"col":"#c9bfae","constraints":[],"rollback":null,"activeSketch":"sk_1mruo","variables":[],"referenceGeometry":[],"definitionId":"cm_mv2812q1","documentVersion":1,"context":{"kind":"part","units":{"length":"mm","angle":"deg","mass":"kg","precision":3},"activeCoordinateSystemId":"origin"},"customProperties":{"Description":"Source printed8-34 / PDF412, Planchard2021 Chapter8 review Q1-Q16. Independent source-grounded explanations and assembly procedure examples authored with ordinary browser Drawing notes; no official answer-key, newly authored CAD or certification claim. Existing assembly workflow evidence remains separately scoped."},"drawing":{"version":1,"draftingStandard":"custom","secondaryUnits":"","secondaryPrecision":2,"size":"A3","orientation":"landscape","projection":"third","units":"mm","scale":"fit","showHidden":true,"showCenters":true,"showZones":true,"views":[],"dims":[],"notes":[{"id":"nndtk1cv","x":34.755904449194375,"y":24.64126801587906,"text":"CHAPTER8 - REVIEW ANSWERS Q1-Q16\nSource: printed8-34 / PDF412, Planchard2021.\nIndependent explanations with assembly procedure examples.\nNo official answer-key, authored CAD or certification claim.","leader":null},{"id":"ncgzbecz","x":34.755904449194375,"y":59.6884669389522,"text":"Q1 - Part template for assembly\nFalse. Start an assembly from an Assembly template,with its own\nunits/properties. The book creates ASM-IN-ANSI and ASM-MM-ISO.","leader":null},{"id":"n31nr04u","x":34.755904449194375,"y":75.2093767842327,"text":"Q2 - Distance versus Coincident\nDistance enforces a nonzero signed separation,e.g.2.54mmSwitch/Handle\nclearance. Coincident makes appropriate references share a\nlocation/plane,e.g.a flange seated on a shoulder.","leader":null},{"id":"nir86j9i","x":34.755904449194375,"y":94.23499460391389,"text":"Q3 - Assembly/subassembly\nAn assembly groups part/component occurrences and mates. An assembly\ninserted inside another assembly is a subassembly;it is the same document\ntype used at a nested level.","leader":null},{"id":"nly0etyo","x":34.755904449194375,"y":113.26063075883606,"text":"Q4 - Five modeling practices\nPlan the component hierarchy;ground a meaningful reference component;use\nfunctional mating geometry;constrain only intended freedoms;check\nmovement/interference. Additional practices:reuse subassemblies,organize\nnames/metadata,avoid redundant mates,and test source-edit propagation.","leader":null},{"id":"nl90bbfu","x":34.755904449194375,"y":135.7909748881589,"text":"Q5 - Interference test\nRun Interference Detection on the required component scope and inspect\nexact positive overlapping volumes. Example:the\nsource-selectedHousing/Battery check is clear,while the separate\nall-visible FLASHLIGHT report records two unreviewed overlaps. Bounding-box\noverlap alone is not exact interference.","leader":null},{"id":"n6lcjrrl","x":34.755904449194375,"y":161.8260269918824,"text":"Q6 - Deform\nA shape-modification feature that changes geometry using controls such as\npoint,curve-to-curve or surface-based deformation. It is different from\nrigid component movement and is not a structural-analysis result.","leader":null},{"id":"nu41l4h4","x":34.755904449194375,"y":180.85166314680455,"text":"Q7 - Mates and purpose\nGeometric relationships between component references that locate/align\nparts and remove specified degrees of freedom,while retaining intentional\nmovement.","leader":null},{"id":"nzm286zs","x":34.755904449194375,"y":199.87728096648576,"text":"Q8 - Six DOF\nThree translations alongX,Y,Z and three rotations aboutX,Y,Z for a free\nrigid occurrence.","leader":null},{"id":"ndd9tzwt","x":225.01213765172912,"y":59.6884669389522,"text":"Q9 - Fixed component\nTrue within its parent assembly frame:a fixed occurrence cannot move\nrelative to that frame. A nested rigid assembly can still move as a whole\nin a higher-level assembly.","leader":null},{"id":"nmyjton8","x":225.01213765172912,"y":78.71410309387437,"text":"Q10 - Section view\nAn imaginary cutting plane removes the nearer material for visualization so\ninternal features are visible;cut material is typically hatched in a\ndrawing.","leader":null},{"id":"n13fb9sp","x":225.01213765172912,"y":97.73972091355554,"text":"Q11 - Suppressed feature/component\nSuppressed feature is omitted from part rebuild; suppressed component is\nomitted from active assembly participation/configuration.\nExample:LensShield's source suppression/restoration versus suppressing an\noptional assembly component. Hidden only affects display and is not\nsuppression.","leader":null},{"id":"n3tlfl43","x":225.01213765172912,"y":123.77479135252005,"text":"Q12 - Concentric faces\nTypically cylindrical/conical faces or circular references whose axes can\nbe aligned;actual valid selectable geometry determines the mate.","leader":null},{"id":"nbw1gmjj","x":225.01213765172912,"y":139.29568286255957,"text":"Q13 - Standard mate types/help\nBook lists\nCoincident,Parallel,Perpendicular,Tangent,Concentric,Lock,Distance,Angle.\nFor Tangent selection combinations and options,use SOLIDWORKS Help/Mate\nPropertyManager help.","leader":null},{"id":"niyp2kfo","x":225.01213765172912,"y":161.8260269918824,"text":"Q14 - Only planes as references\nFalse. Suitable faces,edges,axes,vertices,points and origins can also be\nused.","leader":null},{"id":"n0ymmg2n","x":225.01213765172912,"y":177.3469368371629,"text":"Q15 - Only faces as references\nFalse. Suitable planes,axes,edges,points,vertices and origins are also\nvalid.","leader":null},{"id":"n5n74d01","x":225.01213765172912,"y":192.8678466824434,"text":"Q16 - Exploded view steps\nChoose Exploded View,select components and translation/rotation\ndirection,set distances/angles,record ordered explode steps,accept/save,and\ncollapse/replay as needed. Add explode lines and drawing/BOM balloons\nseparately when required.","leader":null}],"primitives":[],"title":{"revision":"A","sheet":1,"sheets":1,"title":"CHAPTER8 - REVIEW Q1-Q16","number":"PLANCHARD8-34/PDF412","author":"","company":"","material":"","finish":"","mass":"","date":"2026-10-10","tolerance":""},"seeded":true},"lastStandardsAudit":{"at":1791626388339,"ok":true,"checked":0,"blocking":[]},"exactTopologyCache":{}},"assemblies":[],"drawings":[],"metadata":{"generator":"ModelForge CAD SolidWorks-Class","units":"mm","attachmentStorage":"content-addressed","activeDocument":{"type":"part","key":"cm_mv2812q1"}},"attachments":[]}